# full - every package the build produces which belongs on a running
# system, in build order.
#
# Generated, minus distros/core/packages.list and minus the packages whose
# build script carries a '# BUILD_ONLY:' line - rust, nodejs, nasm and the
# rest of the scaffolding, which exist only to compile something else.
# Regenerate after adding a package with:
#
#   ./scripts/packages/list-runtime-packages.sh \
#     | grep -vxF -f <(grep -vE '^\s*#|^\s*$' distros/core/packages.list)

